{"ID":"20240506100119-ngdm9uy","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506100119-ngdm9uy","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506100119-ngdm9uy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240627113625-1u3arxm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240612143228-hwco8y1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240612141953-ecgn2lu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"245蜚蠊（蜚廉、蟑螂）","type":"doc","updated":"20240821171609"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240627113625-1u3arxm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627113625-1u3arxm","updated":"20240627113625"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240627113625-dhte300.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240627113804-jivngr4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627113804-jivngr4","updated":"20240627113804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 592px;","style":"width: 582px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蜚蠊4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蜚蠊4-20240627113804-duw331l.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 582px;\" parent-style=\"width: 592px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 508px;","style":"width: 498px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蜚蠊5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蜚蠊5-20240627114039-umsxlm2.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 498px;\" parent-style=\"width: 508px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240612141953-ecgn2lu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612141953-ecgn2lu","updated":"20240821171609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 540px;","style":"width: 530px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蜚蠊3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蜚蠊3-20240627113712-ubfoeqv.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 530px;\" parent-style=\"width: 540px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 660px;","style":"width: 650px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蜚蠊"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蜚蠊-20240627113538-1h0mnqx.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 650px;\" parent-style=\"width: 660px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240627114126-6g643te","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240627114126-6g643te"}},{"ID":"20240627114127-a7cziym","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240627114127-a7cziym","updated":"20240627114131"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜚廉《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240627114127-8e65zzo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627114127-8e65zzo","updated":"20240627114127"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240627114127-bb3wh79","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627114127-bb3wh79","updated":"20240627114127"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主血淤，（《御览》引云逐下血），症坚，寒热，破积聚，喉咽痹，内寒，无子。生川泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240627114127-4dzc1ma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627114127-4dzc1ma","updated":"20240627114127"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：蜚廉虫。神农黄帝云：治妇人寒热（《御览》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240627114127-u1w4mzy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627114127-u1w4mzy","updated":"20240627114127"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生晋阳及人家屋间，立秋采。"}]},{"ID":"20240627114127-2jo7lmy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627114127-2jo7lmy","updated":"20240627114127"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《说文》云：蜰，卢蜰也，蜚、臭虫，负蠜也，蠜、目蠜也。《广雅》云：飞蜰，飞蠊也。《尔雅》云：蜚，蜰.郭璞云：即负盘臭虫。《唐本》注云：汉中人食之下气，名曰石美，一名卢蜰，一石负盘，旧作蠊，据刑昺疏引此作廉。"}]},{"ID":"20240612141954-q3pvgx8","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612141954-q3pvgx8"}},{"ID":"20240612142302-fxvakfz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612142302-fxvakfz","updated":"20240612142306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜚蠊《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240612142302-5aqtlhd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612142302-5aqtlhd","updated":"20240612142302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，寒，有毒。主血瘀，症坚寒热，破积聚，喉咽痹，内寒无子，通利血脉，生晋阳川泽及人家屋间，立秋采。"}]},{"ID":"20240612141954-5cr2v7j","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612141954-5cr2v7j"}},{"ID":"20240612142253-iahe8zm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612142253-iahe8zm","updated":"20240612142256"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜚蠊《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612142253-h8oqgwz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612142253-h8oqgwz","updated":"20240612142253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，寒，有毒。主血瘀，症坚，寒热，破积聚，喉咽闭，内寒无子，通利血脉。生晋阳川泽及人家屋间，立秋采。"}]},{"ID":"20240612142253-jcuacdt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612142253-jcuacdt","updated":"20240612142253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"形亦似 虫而轻小能飞，本在草中。八月、九月知寒，多入人家屋里逃尔。有两三种，以啖之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612142253-vyszfsw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612142253-vyszfsw","updated":"20240612142253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕此虫，味辛辣而臭，汉中人食之，言下气，名曰石姜，一名卢 ，一名负盘。"}]},{"ID":"20240612142253-0ax8k6i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612142253-0ax8k6i","updated":"20240612142253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《别录》云∶形似蚕蛾，腹下赤，二月、八月采此，即南人谓之滑虫者也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612141954-o95w4el","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612141954-o95w4el"}},{"ID":"20240612142237-2c38m1i","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612142237-2c38m1i","updated":"20240612142241"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜚蠊《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240612142237-j28h7jk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612142237-j28h7jk","updated":"20240612142237"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」石姜、负盘、滑虫、茶婆虫、香娘子。"}]},{"ID":"20240612142237-3rpk9yb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612142237-3rpk9yb","updated":"20240612142237"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」咸、寒、有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612142237-wgu0lb2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612142237-wgu0lb2","updated":"20240612142237"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」瘀血，症坚，寒热，下气，利血脉。"}]},{"ID":"20240612141954-zvcxeri","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612141954-zvcxeri"}},{"ID":"20240612141955-60agz1r","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612141955-60agz1r","updated":"20240612142000"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜚蠊《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240612141955-nwel0uw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612141955-nwel0uw","updated":"20240612141955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"形似蚕蛾，腹下赤，多在林树间，百十为聚，八九月知寒，多飞入人家，作姜气者是。味咸寒，有毒。主破瘀血坚 ，寒热积聚，内寒无子。通血脉，治喉痹。去翅足，炒黄色。"}]},{"ID":"20240612141956-067udd1","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612141956-067udd1"}},{"ID":"20240612142008-8glnfsu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612142008-8glnfsu","updated":"20240612142016"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜚蠊《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240612142008-ohmk628","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612142008-ohmk628","updated":"20240612142008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有毒．通利血脉．生晋阳及人家屋间，立秋采．又，蜚蠊，形似蚕蛾，腹下赤．二月、八月采．"}]},{"ID":"20240612142008-7zjg2zx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612142008-7zjg2zx","updated":"20240612142008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文∶蜚蠊，味咸，寒．主血瘀症坚寒热，破积聚，喉咽痹，内寒无子．生川泽．"}]},{"ID":"20240612142009-55phhzg","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612142009-55phhzg"}},{"ID":"20240612143226-uq2ew56","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-uq2ew56","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《全国中草药汇编》：蟑螂"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-clxljzn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-clxljzn","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-oi99bye","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-oi99bye","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Zhānɡ Lánɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-h14qx35","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-h14qx35","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-pkynx7o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-pkynx7o","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 偷油婆、蜚蠊"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-8xbhpy3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-8xbhpy3","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-wh2gjat","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-wh2gjat","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蜚蠊科昆虫"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"澳洲大蠊"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Periplaneta australasie Fabricius 或"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"美洲蜚蠊"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（大蜚蠊）P. americana L.，以干燥"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"虫体"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入药。四季可捕捉，开水烫死，晒干或烘干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-w0y23xw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-w0y23xw","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-4znxlj7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-4znxlj7","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 咸，寒。有小毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-vjg6pze","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-vjg6pze","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-afzdeq1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-afzdeq1","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 散瘀消结，解毒利尿。用于咽喉痛，扁桃体炎，小儿疳积，肝硬化腹水，小便不利；外用治蛇虫咬伤，痈疮肿毒，脚气水肿，气喘，小便淋浊。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-a71wun9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-a71wun9","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-217vx9a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-217vx9a","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 3～5只，去足翅焙干研粉服。外用适量捣烂敷患处。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-iqxixnc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-iqxixnc","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-hk10odd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-hk10odd","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-rf9y9af","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-rf9y9af","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：蟑螂"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-5jyrqlp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-5jyrqlp","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-5qu1rfv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-5qu1rfv","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Zhānɡ Lánɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-dbkfphs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-dbkfphs","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-cl6s0yj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-cl6s0yj","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蜚、蠦蜰（《尔雅》），蜚蠊（《本经》），飞蟅（《广雅》），负盘（《尔雅》郭瑛注），石姜，滑虫（《唐本草》），茶婆虫、香娘子（《纲目》），赃郎（《纲目拾遗》），偷油婆（《分类草药性》），酱虫（《贵州民间方药集》），黄贼（《陆川本草》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-xx9mtkb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-xx9mtkb","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-rq6abz6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-rq6abz6","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《纲目拾遗》"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-he2qvbv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-he2qvbv","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-i85ms8c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-i85ms8c","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为蜚蠊科昆虫"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"东方蠊"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"全虫"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。全年均可捕捉。沸水烫死，洗净，焙干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-yj8s573","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-yj8s573","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-1sku325","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-1sku325","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 全国大部地区均有分布。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-5s9s2s1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-5s9s2s1","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-z9grpc2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-z9grpc2","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 体椭圆形，背腹扁平，长约2.5厘米，深褐色，有油状光泽。头部向腹面弯曲，大部分隐在前胸下面；头小，复眼1对，单眼2个，口器咀嚼式；触角甚长，丝状，环节圆筒形，约有100余节。前胸背板甚大，中，后胸较小；雄虫有短翅2对，仅掩盖腹部约2/3；雌虫的翘退化，前翅仅呈现2小片，后翅消失。足3对，多毛，胫节及跗节皆长。跗节分为5节，具2爪。腹部10节，末端有尾须1对。不完全变态；初孵的幼虫色白，经一次蜕变而成褐色之稚虫，复经5次蜕变而成成虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-x5avtq7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-x5avtq7","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多栖于人家灶间内，昼隐夜出，喜食菜、饭及液体食物，取食时，每排出粪便及分泌恶臭的液体。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-dtnm4kj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-dtnm4kj","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此外，常见的尚有美洲蠊及澳洲蠊等种。体大，均呈暗褐色，雌雄都有翅。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-d5bk407","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-d5bk407","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-1uml08h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-1uml08h","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 东方蠊、美洲蠊等的坚韧而有强抗药性的表皮，含有巩膜质。巩膜质是蟑螂用其自身产生的水溶性蛋白质与醌之类鞣成的物质，其制造过程，基本上与用皮和鞣酸制革相似而较复杂。蟑螂的卵巢亦有巩膜质，其产生方式亦与表皮相同。表皮又含甲壳质，它是氨基已经乙酰化的氨基葡萄糖所成的多糖类，实际在表皮内，是与蛋白质结合在一起的；美洲蠊表皮的壳质化的部分，含壳质22％，在内表皮约含60％。表皮表面尚有蜡层，如此更增强表皮的避水能力与抗药性。此蜡层为蜡与一种溶剂所成，例如美洲蠊，此蜡是熔点56℃,分子量在300～350之间的蜡，溶剂在常温是液体，分子量在120～170之间。此外，在表皮中尚有少量类似虫胶的物质存在。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-16ijmka","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-16ijmka","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"美洲蠊的肌肉水解，生成亮氨酸，苯丙氨酸，缬氨酸-蛋氨酸、酪氨酸、脯氨酸、丙氨酸、谷氨酸-苏氨酸、甘氨酸-丝氨酸、精氨酸、组氨酸、赖氨酸-胱氨酸。美洲蠊的红肌比白肌较富于细胞色素；其肌肉带红色，认为是由于细胞色素a，b及c所致；红髋肌中的辅酶A，比白肌大4.5倍；体中能合成甾醇，并不用油酸、棕榈酸、三油酸甘油酯及香猫酮为原料，亦不因饲以胆甾醇而增其甾醇含量；体中胆甾醇的周转，较哺乳动物迟缓。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-ogaopeb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-ogaopeb","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"东方蠊的精化酶有蛋白酶、淀粉酶、酯酶、二肽酶、地衣酶、麦芽糖酶等。澳洲蠊消化道有酯酶、蛋白酶、淀粉酶，但显然不存在乳糖酶、纤维素酶及胃蛋白酶，东方蠊背部、尾部分泌一种带绿色粘液，干燥后成赭色无定形块，其中含多量蛋白质。此外尚含碳水化物、灰分等；蛋白质水解；生天门冬氨酸、谷氨酸、丝氨酸、甘氨酸等约10种氨基酸。视网膜杆含一感光色素，可能即是视紫红质。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-ge050kg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-ge050kg","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蟑螂的马尔皮基氏系是一分泌器官而兼贮藏维生素的器官；例如美洲蠊此系贮藏维生素B1、B2（有游离与结合二型）、烟酸、泛酸、抗坏血酸。东方蠊雄者含维生素B2_11.5微克/克，雌者6.43微克/克；两性皆含多数的黄素单核甙酸；除B2外，尚有两个为量较多的类似物质。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-5g96jqb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-5g96jqb","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-7s10spw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-7s10spw","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 咸，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-elrcj5b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-elrcj5b","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味咸，寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-evvrwxo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-evvrwxo","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"有毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-rxdwm1u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-rxdwm1u","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《唐本草》：\"辛辣。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-jfx3y5z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-jfx3y5z","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-b65ur38","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-b65ur38","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 破瘀，化积，消肿，解毒。治症瘕积聚，小儿疳积，疔疮，喉蛾，痈肿，蛇虫咬伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-czuaegr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-czuaegr","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主血瘀症坚，寒热，破积聚，喉咽闭。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-6cxv142","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-6cxv142","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"通利血脉。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-vxxjhvl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-vxxjhvl","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《唐本草》：\"下气。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-00t8l5b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-00t8l5b","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《分类草药性》：\"治一切饮食诸毒。同蜈蚣捣烂包鱼口，消疮，敷结毒，治喉蛾。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-yhsnsow","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-yhsnsow","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《陆川本草》）：\"驱风解热，通血脉。治小儿伤风感冒（煎水服），并治偏身不遂（与瘦肉捣肉饼蒸服），肿疡（外敷）。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-e7o7ld7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-e7o7ld7","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-nvaryw0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-nvaryw0","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，1～3只；或焙干研末。外用：捣敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-45qyg6e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-45qyg6e","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-em8b3cq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-em8b3cq","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治儿疳初起：蟑螂，去头、足、翅，新瓦焙干，常与食之。（《百草镜》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-al5hgan","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-al5hgan","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治臌胀：蟑螂一个（焙干），萝卜子一撮。共炒为末，好酒吞。（《周益生家宝方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-tj76f19","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-tj76f19","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治疔疮：蟑螂大者七个，去头、足，壳，将砂糖少许，同捣烂，敷疔四围，露出头。（《纲目拾遗》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-5wbllvj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-5wbllvj","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④解诸疔毒：灶上红蟑螂五个。研烂，热酒冲服。取汗为度。（《养素园传信方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-gcnqlhw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-gcnqlhw","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治喉蛾：偷油婆、人指甲（煅）、开喉箭。为末吹喉。（《四川中药志》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-y6p2izk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-y6p2izk","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治白火丹：蟑螂，瓦上焙干，为末，白滚汤服一、二个。兼治疔疮。（《纲目拾遗》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-5zi4jbg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-5zi4jbg","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治对口：桂州荔枝肉二、三枚，蟑螂二、三个。同捣如泥，敷，露头。（《慈航活人书》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-xp9qfro","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-xp9qfro","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治无名肿毒：蟑螂十个，盐一撮。同捣烂敷之，留头。（《慈航活人书》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-ul6f2ix","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-ul6f2ix","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治吐血：蟑螂五个，止去翅净，在火盆净瓦上焙干，为末，用湿腐皮包一个，滚汤吞下。每日如此，吞五日，不可间断。（《纲目拾遗》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-yxy4gaw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-yxy4gaw","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治梅毒：偷油婆、蛞蝓。焙焦，研末，兑猪胆汁服。（《四川中药志》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-fc6rkod","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-fc6rkod","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治蜈蚣及蛇、虫咬伤：偷油婆、剪刀草、海椒叶。共捣绒涂。（《四川中药志》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-yqdxm9h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-yqdxm9h","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-4a7xrh2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-4a7xrh2","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-my9m76v","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-my9m76v","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：蟑螂"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-3cozjk3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-3cozjk3","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-wh505e7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-wh505e7","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Zhānɡ Lánɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-z092vdx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-z092vdx","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-kuzayen","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-kuzayen","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蜚、蜚蠊、负盘、石姜、滑虫、茶婆虫、香娘子、赃郎、偷油婆、酱虫"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-oo1lmh4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-oo1lmh4","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-p7fyevg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-p7fyevg","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Oriental Cockroach， Americah Cockroach， Australian Cockroach"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-jwjcc0y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-jwjcc0y","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-hnbb9w3","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-hnbb9w3","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240612143226-rtmvhel","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-rtmvhel","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240612143226-012ronn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-012ronn","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶弘景，萤镰，形亦似魔虫而轻小能飞，本在草中，八月、多人人家屋里逃尔☆有两、三种，以作廉姜气者为真，南人亦吠之。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-hkhrec5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-hkhrec5","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《唐本草》：萤镰，味辛辣而臭，汉中入食之，言下气。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-66m6hta","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-66m6hta","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《纲目》：萤煽，今人家壁间灶下极多，甚者聚至千百，身似蚕蛾，腹背俱赤，两翅能飞，喜灯火光，其气甚臭，其屎尼甚。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-jrlgn12","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-jrlgn12","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《药对》云：立夏之先，萤镰先生，为人参、获苍使。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-1gyiwe8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-1gyiwe8","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-qqc783v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-qqc783v","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为蜚蠊科动物美洲大蠊、东方蜚蠊、澳洲蜚蠊的全体。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-fva1cwz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-fva1cwz","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：1.Periplaneta americana (Linnaeus)2.Blatta orientalis Linnaeus.3.Periplaneta australasiae (Fabricius)"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-fpnngvi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-fpnngvi","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：夜间在厨房、墙角、坑边、仓库等处捕捉，鲜且，或用沸水烫死，晒干或烘干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-xu22caq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-xu22caq","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-zfosjo0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-zfosjo0","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：喜居于家室内，特别是温暖有食物的地方。白昼匿居于阴暗隐蔽处，晚间出来活动，杂食性。能分泌一种特有臭味的油状液体。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-zt4ix17","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-zt4ix17","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：1.主要分布于我国北方各地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-uamy3ho","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-uamy3ho","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.全国各地均有分布。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-u3gixmv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-u3gixmv","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.分布于热带、亚热带地区。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-qifr3wy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-qifr3wy","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-ue6mze4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-ue6mze4","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.美洲大蠊，体长4-5cm，椭圆形而扁，红褐色，有光泽。头小，隐于前胸下，触角鞭状，超过翅的末端。前胸背圆形。翅发达，盖过腹部的末端，前翅较小，叶状，工质，有赤褐色的翅脉。后翅大，膜质，扇状。足长而侧扁。腹部各节后缘浓赤褐色。尾端有2长2短的尾毛，司嗅觉功用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-vzw3uys","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-vzw3uys","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.东方蜚蠊，体中型，长约25mm，全身黑色或暗褐色，前胸背板颜色一律；有短翅，雄虫不到腹部后端；雌虫只有1对小片。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-7xf4a1m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-7xf4a1m","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.澳洲蜚蠊，形态与美洲蜚蠊相似，体较小，浅褐棕色，全长约3.5cm。特点为：前翅基部的外侧边缘有明显的黄色宽纹带，触角短，不超过翅的末端。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-d2a08zy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-d2a08zy","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-kitrc5e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-kitrc5e","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别（1）美洲蜚蠊，本品呈椭圆形，较大，长4.3-5.5cm。体红褐色，背腹扁平，头小，向腹面倾斜，触角1对，长线状，复眼发达，肾形，单眼2个。前胸扩大如盾黄色宽带纹。足3对，侧扁，基节宽大，腿节有胫节上具刺，跗5节，末端有2爪；翅2对，膜质，前翅小，后翅大，掩盖腹端；腹部末端有尾须1对。质松脆，易碎。气微腥，味微咸。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-xca4tzw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-xca4tzw","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）东方蜚蠊，体呈椭圆形，背腹扁平，长约 2.5cm，外表面深褐色，有油状光泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-7k6quhr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-7k6quhr","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（3）澳洲蜚蠊，形与美洲蜚蠊相似，体较小，体褐棕色，体长约3.5cm。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-9jxrlkn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-9jxrlkn","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-mzy659p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-mzy659p","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 美洲蜚蠊含乙酰胆碱酯酶（acetylcholinesterase），但中肠和脂肪体不含；还含美洲蜚蠊酮（periplanone）A、B和三种、肽类，定名为普洛克托林（proctolin），MI和MII。此外，还含锌。组织中含中性脂质（neutral lipid），多巴胺（dopamine），N-乙酰基多巴胺（N-acetyldopamine），多巴胺-3-O硫酸酯（dopamine-3-Osulfate）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-i39uwx5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-i39uwx5","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脂肪体含脂肪酸（fatty acid），糖原磷酸化酶（glycogen phosphorylase）b、ab和a。此外，脂肪体还含丙酮酸激酶（pyruvate kinase），黄嘌呤氧化酶（xanthine oxidase）。神经系统及神经组织含肽类（peptide），多巴胺，N-乙酰基多巴胺，色氨酸（tryptophan），5-羟色胺（5-HT），及一种-5-羟基-3-吲哚基乙酸（5-hydroxyindoleacetic acid）样物质。还含酪氨酸（tyrosine），神经索含脂肪酸（fatty acid）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-k1ofkra","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-k1ofkra","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脑中含乙酰胆碱（acetylcholine），多巴胺，5-5羟色胺，谷氨酸脱羟酶（glutamate decarboxylase，GAD），γ-氨基丁酸转氨酶（GABA-transaminase）。及酸性和碱性磷酸（酯）酶（acid and alkaline phosphatase）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-k4bctjv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-k4bctjv","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"血淋巴含17种游离氨基酸，主要有异亮氨酸（isoleucine）亮氨酸（leucine），缬氨酸（valine），苯丙氨酸（phenylalanine），酪氨酸，色氨酸，蛋氨酸（methionine），赖氨酸（lysine），甘氨酸（glycine），脯氨酸（proline）。还含多巴胺，N-乙酰基多巴胺，5-羟色胺，及6种蛋白质（protein）。心侧体含两种肽；高血糖激素（hyperglycemic hormone,HGH）I和II。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-5kjivio","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-5kjivio","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胚胎期含蜕皮甾体（ecdysteroid）。触角含真蛸胺（octopamine）。腹部腺体分泌物含有气味成分：对-甲酚（p-cresol），对-乙基苯酚（p-ethylphenol），对-乙烯工苯酚（p-vinylphenol）.雄性虫体含9种氨基酸：丙氨酸（alanine）。天冬氨酸（aspartate），胱氨酸（cystine），谷氨酸（glutamate），异亮氨酸，亮氨酸，苯丙氨酸，酪氨酸，缬氨酸。雌性卵巢和卵含蜕皮甾酮，卵黄磷蛋白（vitellin）含低聚糖（oligosaccharide）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-sx971du","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-sx971du","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"东方蜚蠊全体含过每原（变应原）成分（allergenic components）。表皮及卵巢含有巩膜质（selerotin），甲壳质（chitin）。消化酶有蛋白酶（protease），淀粉酶（amylase），酯酶（estrase），二肽酶（dipeptidase），地衣酶（lichenase），麦芽糖酶（maltase）等。视网膜杆含视紫红质（rhodopsin）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-lzhq4x8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-lzhq4x8","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-b0m1uz8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-b0m1uz8","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 烘干全虫（去翅、足）95%乙醇提取的油状物，对S-180的癌细胞有较明显的抑制作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-12pnt1k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-12pnt1k","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-ru5qzvj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-ru5qzvj","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《医学入门》：“去翅、足，炒黄色。”现行，取原药材，除去杂质，焙干研末。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-hpm67x8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-hpm67x8","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-ql4adg9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-ql4adg9","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肝；脾；肾经"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-wtqy71a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-wtqy71a","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-4h0wne0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-4h0wne0","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味咸；性寒"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-mnw4aj1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-mnw4aj1","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-rtltdpc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-rtltdpc","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 孕妇忌用；立夏之先，蜚蠊先生，为人参，茯苓使。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-t0uqsks","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-t0uqsks","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-f0xpyv6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-f0xpyv6","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 散瘀；化积；解毒。主症瘕积聚；小儿疳积；喉痹；乳蛾；痈疮肿毒；虫蛇咬伤"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-rkak97o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-rkak97o","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-m4f4oya","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-m4f4oya","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，0.5-1.5g（或1-3只）；或研末。外用：适量，捣敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-6p0zvoy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-6p0zvoy","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-12yy9y7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-12yy9y7","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治儿疳初起：蟑螂，去头、足、翅，新瓦焙干，常与食之。(《百草镜》)②治臌胀；蟑螂一个(焙干)，萝卜子一撮。共炒为末，好酒吞。(《周益生家宝方》)③治疗疮：蟑螂大者七个，去头、足、壳，将砂糖少许，同捣烂，敷疔四围，露出头。(《纲目拾遗》)④解诸疔毒：灶上红蟑螂五个。研烂，热酒冲服，取汗为度。(《养素园传信方》)⑤治喉蛾：偷油婆、人指甲(煅)、开喉箭。为末吹喉。(《四川中药志》)⑥治白火丹：蟑螂，瓦上焙干，为末，白滚汤服一、二个。兼治疔疮。(《纲目抢遗》)⑦治对口：桂州荔枝肉二、三枚，蟑螂二、三个。同捣如泥，敷，露头。(《慈航活人书》)⑧治无名肿毒：蟑螂十个，盐一撮。同捣烂敷之，留头。(《慈航活人书》)⑨治吐血：蟑螂五个，止去翅净，在火盆净瓦上焙干，为末，用湿腐皮包一个，滚汤吞下。每日如此，吞五日，不可间断。(《纲目拾遗》)⑩治梅毒：偷油婆、蛞蝓。焙焦，研末，兑猪胆汁服。(《四川中药志》)(11)治娱蚁及蛇、虫咬伤：偷油婆、剪刀草、海椒叶。共捣绒涂。(《四川中药志》)"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-j3nhimq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-j3nhimq","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-g65893z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-g65893z","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本经》：主血瘀，寒热，破积聚，喉咽闭。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-70emomf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-70emomf","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《别录》：通利血脉。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-l3fst5w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-l3fst5w","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《唐本草》：下气。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-0ajd1u4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-0ajd1u4","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《分类草药性》：治一切饮食诸毒。同蜈蚣捣烂包鱼口，消疮，敷结毒，治喉娥。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-6pusjct","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-6pusjct","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《陆川本草》：驱风解热，通血脉。治小儿伤风感冒(煎水服)，并治偏身不遂(与瘦肉捣肉饼蒸服)， 肿疡(外敷)。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-umwe5u6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-umwe5u6","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612143226-2uey0rm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143226-2uey0rm","updated":"20240612143226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612143227-ngu3gti","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612143227-ngu3gti"}},{"ID":"20240612143228-hwco8y1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143228-hwco8y1"}}]}